    "fixed, the weights ignored", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "89fab93d-871f-41c9-b6e0-24718b42d1fc"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "14c87842-49d1-4369-bcc3-2935aadb94f3"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
