  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c822bfaf-e0ce-46ee-8326-bb0d739766b9"],
 " on the whole walk, and a bare integer as budget, leave the call \
unevaluated:"
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"91231625-7d2d-4215-8ea9-3cee80143ed7"],

